Q("What is Gibbs free energy (ΔG)?",["ΔG = ΔH − TΔS — determines spontaneity: ΔG < 0 (spontaneous)","Enthalpy only","Entropy only","Internal energy"],"ΔG = ΔH − TΔS — determines spontaneity: ΔG < 0 (spontaneous)"),
