Q("What is the Nernst equation?",["Relates electrode potential to concentration at non-standard conditions: E = E° − (RT/nF)lnQ","The Arrhenius equation","The Gibbs equation","The Henderson-Hasselbalch equation"],"Relates electrode potential to concentration at non-standard conditions: E = E° − (RT/nF)lnQ"),
